      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5ab3ad272b67505f726c2a8f|full_name}: I agree entirely. We should have confirmations for removing friends too. \n\nWith the nature of VR controls it's all too easy to accidentally click on the wrong thing. Especially times where we may not realize it, like removing or putting on headsets and controllers.\n\nI hope we see this implemented as part of the promised UI overhaul.",
