  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The option to lock your favorite avatars so you don't risk misclicking and unfavoriting an avatar while you aren't using it. This would prevent the countless times I and many other users have accidentally unfavorited an avatar which is public however isn't in 'circulation' anymore. \nThink of it as a safety or confirmation menu, when enabled, you cannot unfavorite avatars and must disable the setting to unfavorite an avatar, which could also be per every avatar as a little square and red lock button that would needed to be clicked first to unfavorite.",
